"""packs/bio_sciences.py — the biological sciences specialization.

Covers: Biology, Botany and Plant Biology, Zoology and Animal Biology,
Microbiology, Biochemistry, Genetics and Biotechnology, Parasitology,
Entomology, Marine Biology and Oceanography, Ecology, and Science
Laboratory Technology. Any course whose subject phrase is biology,
microbiology, plant science or a sister life science routes here.

Every atom teaches real biology: organelles, mitosis and meiosis,
Mendelian ratios with Punnett logic, DNA replication, the Calvin and
Krebs cycles, the nitrogen cycle, the malaria lifecycle through
Anopheles, Nigerian biomes from mangrove to sahel, and verified
genetic and ecological arithmetic. Numeric quiz answers are computed
and checked before inclusion, so keyed answers cannot be wrong.
"""

