        "Herbaria and water agencies rely on the preservation technique {S} standardises. University herbaria hold pressed, labelled plant collections that map Nigerian vegetation across decades; water boards keep sampling bottles sterile, dark and cold, testing within hours for coliforms and pH. Field biology succeeds or fails on these small disciplines of collection, labelling and timing.",
