        "Agribusiness turns the same science of {S} into profit: seed companies sell certified hybrid maize; hatcheries supply day-old chicks vaccinated at the factory; catfish farms plan feeding rates against water quality; garri and palm oil processors rely on controlled fermentation. Value chains from the grain markets of Kano to the palm belts of the Delta run on applied biology.",
